<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1>Great news, <%= @appointment_request.guest_name %>!</h1>

    <p>Your appointment request has been <strong>accepted</strong>.</p>

    <h2>Appointment Details</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Nutritionist:</strong> <%= @nutritionist.name %></li>
      <li><strong>Date:</strong> <%= @appointment_request.requested_at.strftime("%B %d, %Y at %H:%M") %></li>
      <li><strong>Location:</strong> <%= @nutritionist.location %></li>
    </ul>

    <p>Please make sure to arrive on time. If you need to cancel or reschedule, please contact us.</p>

    <p>Best regards,<br>The NutriWA Team</p>
  </body>
</html>
